| 5. Sparse/root publication: 1,000 labels separated balanced grow-shrink-space scene publication | 5.247042 / 6.105750 | 5.137084 / 5.693334 | 3.592083 / 5.375042 | Preserved gain against both. |
| 6. Selected copy/inspection: edit and independently copy one label among 1,000 labels | 3.227541 / 4.251042 | 5.937166 / 7.254458 | 2.138250 / 2.789666 | Preserved gain against both. |
